# OPTIONAL. Copy to `.env.local` (git-ignored) only to override the defaults.
# Values here are PUBLIC: they are baked into the app and anyone can read them.
# Never put secrets in EXPO_PUBLIC_* variables.
#
# Without this file, development picks the API automatically (src/lib/config.ts):
#  - browser   (pnpm dev:web)   → http://localhost:8787  (run `pnpm dev:api` too)
#  - Expo Go   (pnpm dev:phone) → https://bdgtr-api.erroldee.com
# Real builds always set it explicitly (Cloudflare Pages env, eas.json).
#
# Example override, to point an Android emulator at your local API:
# EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://10.0.2.2:8787
